The legislative texts in this repository are from matsne.gov.ge, published by LEPL Legislative Herald of Georgia
(სსიპ "საქართველოს საკანონმდებლო მაცნე"). Under article 8 of the Law of Georgia on Copyright and Related Rights,
official documents (laws, other normative acts and their official translations) are not objects of copyright.
The texts are reproduced without change to their wording, split into one file per article.

Lexifina's own contributions (tools, file arrangement, commit messages and documentation) are dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
